    "Measured file by file, so large folders take a moment. macOS may ask MYU STATS for access to protected folders such as Documents, Downloads or Desktop. Clones and hard links count once per path, so totals are approximate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "uz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fayllar birma-bir oʻlchanadi, shuning uchun katta jildlar biroz vaqt oladi. macOS MYU STATSdan Documents, Downloads yoki Desktop kabi himoyalangan jildlarga ruxsat soʻrashi mumkin. Klonlar va qattiq havolalar har bir yoʻl uchun alohida hisoblanadi, shuning uchun jami taxminiy."
